    "detailed_description": "Welcome to \u201cBricks Crusher Breaker Ball\u201d - a fun iteration of the classic brick game that's loved all over the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBrick games, including this one, have the potential to bring near infinite fun. <br />\r\nBricks Crusher Breaker Ball has a plethora of hand-crafted levels, many skill blocks and skill balls for you to have fun with, as well as different challenge modes!<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Try it and see how surprisingly addictive such a simple game can get!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBreak bricks, gain coins, unlock various mysterious skill balls, discover new strategies, and even participate in unique duel levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you in need of a casual game to kill time and relieve pressure? Make yourself comfortable with Bricks Crusher Breaker Ball!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Smooth aiming<br />\r\n- 100 + levels<br />\r\n- Timed and unlockable special events<br />\r\n- Many eye candy abilities and blocks<br />\r\n- Hours of brain numbing fun!",
